# Agent instruction files, kept untracked on purpose: `omarchy plugin add` clones this
# repository into ~/.config/omarchy/plugins/, where people run coding agents against their
# own desktop config. A committed CLAUDE.md or AGENTS.md would become standing instructions
# in a stranger's environment. The house rules live in docs/house-rules.md instead.
